{"title":"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For some real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equation\" title=\"Equation\">equation</a>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/7/c776fa3cc39e7fb51e32ea87c738b36491d7ed49.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[8x^3 + 4ax^2 + 2bx + a = 0\\]\" width=\"199\" height=\"16\" />\nhas three distinct positive roots. If the sum of the base-<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logarithm\" title=\"Logarithm\">logarithms</a> of the roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/8/e28c484d71f1b32f74d35a07a64103fea571117b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ -256 \\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ -64  \\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ -8 \\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 64  \\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 256$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"463\" height=\"18\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the three roots be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/0/d500fb815f92dec3dba9e71115d728583cb171d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1,x_2,x_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"68\" height=\"11\" />. \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/a/9eaba1d48b6d1b7d491b25a3503629ff84a91bee.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_2 x_1 + \\log_2 x_2 + \\log_2 x_3 = \\log_2 x_1x_2x_3= 5 \\Longrightarrow x_1x_2x_3 = 32\\]\" width=\"479\" height=\"17\" />\nBy <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_Formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s Formulas\">Vieta’s formulas</a>,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/b/06b76979c050b8824bb4a74150704bf5dd0867a8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[8(x-x_1)(x-x_2)(x-x_3) = 8x^3 + 4ax^2 + 2bx + a\\]\" width=\"393\" height=\"19\" />\ngives us that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/9/619713ce9b26e87814b3e3537ea60625142657d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -8x_1x_2x_3 = -256 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"230\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/40mJNmstTEY\">https://youtu.be/40mJNmstTEY</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B\">2004 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" h